ent than your guild.&nbsp; If you spent more time consentrating on your own guild instead of trashing the reps of EIE, Dol Amroth, or Ascent maybe you would be where we are.&nbsp; Your post was nothing more than spiteful jealousy and an attempt to make yourself feel better through the tarnishing of my guild that has worked hard to get where we are and you come in and say we are only here because we cheat.&nbsp; I am insulted and sick by that remark.<br /><br />Heemann &lt;Echoes in Eternity&gt;<br />70th Wildblood
